ry_count":2},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"qclZoDz3sjT7v5xOSj5P2Q","review_id":"fl5ikYqi4n73MOvhOauc-Q","date":"2014-02-05T01:50:02","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9446976780891418,"text_excerpt":"As everyone else has mentioned, Lafitte's is the oldest bar in America. I can admit that I'm a sucker for that stuff so that's why I wanted to go. But what I really like about it is that it isn't a tourist trap but somewhere that locals hang out. I imagined a really old, dark, quiet place (kind of like Napoleon House Bar & Restaurant) but what I found was a loud, rowdy, typical New Orleans bar. We were there late on a Monday night and it was packed (but it was the night before New Year's Eve). In the front room they have a bar with blended daiquiris brewing in the back - not something I expected to find at the oldest bar in America, so yes I did help myself to one. In the back is a grand ..."},{"business_id":"qclZoDz3sjT7v5xOSj5P2Q","review_id":"vF9MUXC0_7m8wCTQ8_znHA","date":"2015-04-06T03:07:24","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9413084983825684,"text_excerpt":"This place is so cool. You need to check it out if you are in NOLA. The hurricanes are the best I have had, they aren't as sweet as some of the others I had around town. The bar is also lit just by candlelight which was awesome and they have an outdoor area too. Drinks were reasonably priced for the size. Worth the trip to the far end of Bourbon st. to check this place out!"},{"business_id":"qclZoDz3sjT7v5xOSj5P2Q","review_id":"oJXy_7PNknQqSEM3-X4wxQ","date":"2016-11-27T05:49:57","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9409722089767456,"text_excerpt":"This place has the coolest vibe of any bar I've ever been to. There are no lights in here which lends itself to a mysterious kind of spooky yet romantic aura. Weird I know. I was told it's the oldest bar in the US but independent research leads me to believe it's the second oldest. Still, pretty old. For those like me who love history and booze, this spot can't be beat. At night it gets packed and the crowd spills into the street. It is pretty tight inside, since it's essentially a shack. The grape slushy drink they make here is a must as far as I'm concerned! Deliciously potent and refreshing. It's worth walking up to the far end of Bourbon Street to check it out."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"qclZoDz3sjT7v5xOSj5P2Q","photo_id":"qIwcMqGmkUK89THQgtgonA","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/qIwcMqGmkUK89THQgtgonA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8931182622909546},{"business_id":"qclZoDz3sjT7v5xOSj5P2Q","photo_id":"wY3q4PNOKihv6cXuR6oZ6A","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/wY3q4PNOKihv6cXuR6oZ6A.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8835352063179016},{"business_id":"qclZoDz3sjT7v5xOSj5P2Q","photo_id":"NrKKLsCE-Z8qwngZNY2sTA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/NrKKLsCE-Z8qwngZNY2sTA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8813992142677307},{"business_id":"qclZoDz3sjT7v5xOSj5P2Q","photo_id":"NDbjVPIx3DcMxNgkUn3KCw","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/NDbjVPIx3DcMxNgkUn3KCw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8613995313644409},{"business_id":"qclZoDz3sjT7v5xOSj5P2Q","photo_id":"ZUScMeXLji2lP3jyegmREw",